{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken as a slime in a desolate lab with no memory of how you got there or how to escape. The atmosphere is thick with mystery, a small hamster watches your every move. What secrets could be hidden within these dark walls?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3901700/extras/a0776877255653616b84abee3646598f.poster.avif?t=1755733591\" width=320 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3901700/extras/a0776877255653616b84abee3646598f.webm?t=1755733591\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3901700/extras/a0776877255653616b84abee3646598f.mp4?t=1755733591\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the mind-bending puzzles of Portal, the hostile environments of Half-Life, and a chilling retro aesthetic, this game is designed for those who thrive under pressure. Face relentless challenges, outsmart deadly threats, and push your problem-solving skills to the limit. Do you have what it takes to survive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Here are some of the challenges you will have to overcome...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve physics/size based puzzles:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3901700/extras/a3ce0f36b9e542dd0c6c62cf85e9ee76.poster.avif?t=1755733591\" width=320 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3901700/extra